WEBVTT

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.580
Get out!

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:18.910
Do not step foot inside
the Onigasaki estate ever again!

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.580
I understand...

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.200
Damn geezer.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.500
It seems like Master
doesn't have much time left.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.870
That might explain why he's been
so frantic to train Young Master Kai.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.080
Like I care.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.700
I'm not that geezer's tool.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.000
I won't become some ornament for the family.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:01.910
"The Ones Within"

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.290
The transmitter isn't moving anymore.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.700
Got it. Shall we hurry?

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.540
If we're slow, Kudou will smack us.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.330
I'm going, too!

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.790
L-Let me go, dammit!

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:36.450
You can't!

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:36.870
--Outta my way! Move it!

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.250
--And that's how you use the transmitter.
--Outta my way! Move it!

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.410
Please bring them back to us.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.410
We're all counting on you.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:48.950
If we botch this up, we'll
probably get drugged by Roro.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.790
Kudou lets his emotion take over.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:54.370
It was right to leave him behind.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.540
You should be careful yourself.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.080
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.580
In stealth games, rather
than dispatching enemies,

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:07.040
completing the mission and returning
safely are of more importance.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:11.620
Once we free the captives,
we go straight back to the village.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:15.950
Don't even think about the demons.
That's what Paka would want.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:20.790
Fleeing from the enemy, huh?
I'm such a disgrace to my name.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.370
Living is top priority.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:26.200
If it gets in the way, abandon your name.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.160
You're so extreme.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.750
I'm here for a reason.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.700
I'm not letting it end here.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:42.080
You mean the thing with your twin sister?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.500
Say, why did you talk
to me about that anyway?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.870
Everyone else is obediently
playing the game...

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:54.080
...but only you are looking
for the quickest way to escape.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:59.620
In other words, I think you're the
most determined about getting home.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:01.330
"Enter and it'll be a bloodbath"

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:03.000
"Enter and it'll be a bloodbath"
Ooh! This room's pretty fancy
compared to the others!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.620
Ooh! This room's pretty fancy
compared to the others!

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:09.120
I wonder if this is Kikka's room.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:15.120
How is it that you can stay calm
no matter what happens?

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.450
It's bizarre.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.160
But for me, it's perfectly normal.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:25.040
Karin! It looks like there's
a doll house over there!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:28.750
But one that big is almost like a real house!

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:33.950
You're awfully carefree considering
we might end up being eaten.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.250
Eaten...

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.950
That's right... We'll be made into food...

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:41.370
Akatsuki guts mashed into terrine!

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:44.000
Slowly-simmered Akatsuki stew!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.950
Baked and roasted Akatsuki as the main dish!

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:53.000
And for dessert, Akatsuki Iride topped
with loads of whipped cream!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.370
No! Anything but dessert!

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:59.040
Karin's sure in top form.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:05.790
Karin! This bar is bent a little!

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:10.120
You're right, but isn't
it still too tight for us?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.330
I'll give it a shot!

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.580
Look, I slipped out! You hurry up, too!

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.750
Okay!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.580
Huh?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.290
Go ahead, laugh all you want!

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.330
No, I'm not laughing.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.080
Hurry and hide!

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.870
Hmm? Where's the other one?

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.250
Did they slip through the bars?

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.790
Y-You know what? How dare you--

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:55.290
Well, you're the one
I wanted in the first place.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.040
Who really cares?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:00.500
Ooh, so soft! So soft...

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.200
Just what should I do with you?

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.910
This place is big...

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.620
Fortunately, there aren't any guards.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.870
Oshigiri, look.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.120
How elegant...

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:23.120
Achoo! Aw, shucks!

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:24.330
That was...?

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.040
Iride? That you?

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:28.620
Kaikoku! Oshigiri!

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:34.330
I escaped by climbing through the attic.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.830
I see. Glad you're safe. And Sarayashiki?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:42.330
Oh, yeah! Big trouble!
If we're not quick, Karin will...

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.370
Hurry, hurry! This way!

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:50.580
Right here!

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:57.120
--Huh?
--The hell is that?

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.250
It's the dreaded Onibania family.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.790
Sorry, say that again?

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.040
The Onibania family.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:10.750
She takes all the girls she abducts

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.750
and plays a full-scale version of house.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.790
Karin was stripped in the blink of an eye...

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:20.620
...and turned into the newbie maid, Veronica.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.790
And all you did was sit there and watch?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.000
Yes, reluctantly.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.790
Meaning you saw her change clothes?

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.750
Yes, reluctantly.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.500
Wh-What are you guys talking about?

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:37.750
Come on, Veronica. Why don't
you pour me some tea?

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:42.120
You know what? Today I feel like Earl Grey.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.620
Aren't you listening, Veronica?! I'll fire you!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.950
Do it! I wish you would!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.580
Hold up! Are you a newbie?

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.700
I wouldn't defy her if I were you.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:59.450
If you just do as she says,
they won't need to hurt you.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.080
Just because I won't do--

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.870
You'll get disposed of!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:08.580
Yup! If you go against me,
I'll just have my grandpa smush you!

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:12.410
The demons this time are so strong,
it's almost cheating.

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:16.040
If I call for him, my grandpa
will come wherever I am.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:19.790
Unlike your friends who ditch you
and run away on their own.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:25.870
So let's have you make me
a delicious full-course meal, Veronica!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:27.790
See? Awful, right?

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.330
So very awful...

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:33.700
A-Anyway, her life doesn't
seem to be in immediate danger.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:40.830
Iride, do you know where the dungeon
the captives are being kept in is?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:46.410
Um, well, the first place we were
locked up in is over there...

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:49.790
The turtle-shell-bondage-tied
Momotaro tower.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.620
That's disgusting...

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:58.330
I haven't searched the pheasant,
dog, and monkey-tied towers, so...

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:02.080
This place as a whole is truly disgusting.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.790
Whose idea was all this?

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:05.700
Achoo!

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.500
Shall we split up?

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:12.370
Even if you find the dungeon,
come back after confirming they're safe.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:16.540
We can release everyone
after rescuing Sarayashiki.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.290
Meet here in 30.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.500
Okay.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.950
Iride, your foot.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:26.660
Eh? Huh? When did that...?

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.830
But I'm still totally fine!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.250
G-Gah!

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.330
Wrap up both your feet.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.120
Thank you!

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:43.040
All right, I'm off now!

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.290
Yeah, take care.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.910
I almost let that face get the best of me.

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:52.370
That was close...

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.790
Pheasant tower was a bust...

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.830
Did he leave? Not good...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.870
A bracelet...

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.830
Bingo!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.000
Where is the key to this place?

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:25.290
Th-The demon girl with the long
braided hair always has it.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.370
It's gotta be Kikka then.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:30.750
I wonder if she left it
somewhere in that first room.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:37.660
Don't want it.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:41.660
Th-There're no peppers in it.
I-It's got fish flakes.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.830
That's not the issue...

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:53.540
You know what?

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:55.080
Y-Yes?!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:59.870
I've been thinking it for a while,
but you kinda remind me of him.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.290
Dimwitsuki.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.870
Do I really?

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:09.250
Yeah. You know, it's like
your aura or something...

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.950
I take it all back.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:16.790
Where's Yuzu?

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:19.160
She went back to Genome Tower.

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:22.620
She wanted to watch the follow Pakamera.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.450
Iride, your foot.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.870
Eh? Huh? When did that...?

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:43.330
"Enter and it'll be a bloodbath"
I found the key to the dollhouse dungeon!

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:43.950
"Dollhouse Dungeon"
I found the key to the dollhouse dungeon!

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:46.910
"Dollhouse Dungeon"
This has to be it.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.330
Now just to keep out of sight...

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:03.120
You should have behaved and been
a plaything for my granddaughter.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:11.200
I believe you've gone too far, Lord Kihachi.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:14.790
It's you, huh? What do you want?

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.660
Kakuriyo should be outside
of your supervision area.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:22.080
You are free to make such
grand claims, however...

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:26.910
The entirety of 13th Avenue
is under my jurisdiction.

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:30.450
Hand Iride over.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:35.500
And you think I will?
Remember, the lad said it himself...

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:38.500
To dispose of him if needed.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:43.750
Understand, he is someone
who is indispensable to me.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.540
Do you really want this, Lord Kihachi?

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:52.250
Humans can be extremely fragile
and delicate creatures.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:57.950
If you treat him any harsher
than this, I will employ a reset.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:01.790
I am the supervisor.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:06.250
I control the game balance of 13th Avenue.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:11.500
I can overlook if you wish to behave
like the king of the mountain.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:18.080
However, do not forget the fact that
you are merely a character in a game.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:21.000
This which you're currently seeking to do...

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:25.750
...is equivalent to breaking
the game system itself.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:31.250
It is troubling... and we mustn't have it.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:41.790
I hope you can make
a wise decision, Lord Kihachi.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:47.250
Do you not wish to be with your
granddaughter as long as possible?

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:53.290
You buffoon.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.200
Hurry up and get lost.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:03.750
Thank you very much.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:07.080
Oh, you were awake?

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:10.250
Mr. Onigasaki will be coming here shortly.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:13.660
I wish you the best of luck.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.200
Mr. Paka.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:23.950
Do you think... we could be friends?

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:31.000
Mr. Paka, have you always
been here all by yourself?

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.040
Haven't you been lonely?

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.700
You know, I...

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:40.540
I'm really good at escape games.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:44.790
Can't we... escape this place together?

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:47.790
I cannot.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:50.200
But why?

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:54.080
I cannot... because of a promise.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.330
But why?

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.620
Hey, how was it?

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.580
My sister...

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.450
...was here.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:18.700
My sister was here.

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:23.160
"<i>The Ones Within - Genome</i>
Beta Version"

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:28.160
"<i>The Ones Within - Genome</i>
Beta Version"
Two years ago, a beta version of
<i>The Ones Within </i>made rounds on the net.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:28.620
"Congratulations"
Two years ago, a beta version of
<i>The Ones Within </i>made rounds on the net.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:34.370
"Congratulations"
My little sister who played it went missing
right before beating the game.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.500
Out of nowhere.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:42.120
For two years, I followed every single
lead there was, but couldn't find her.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:46.580
The police and my parents were
ready to give up the search.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:51.040
"Congratulations" "As a charismatic
Let's Player, you have been chosen to participate
in a closed stage of <i>The Ones Within - Genome</i>."
Which is why I gambled on my last ray of hope.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:57.540
I purposely got abducted
in order to find my sister.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.000
This...

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:02.120
It's my sister's. It's her name...

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.660
Are you sure?

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:07.000
I don't know, but it's her name...

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.200
It's her name...

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.700
What if Sakura's still here?

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.500
In the dungeons...

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:17.160
Calm down. Where did you find that?

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:21.660
In the pheasant tower...
In a corner of the hall.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:25.410
Where's Iride? It's past 30 minutes.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:28.950
Oshigiri.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:34.080
Why don't you cool your head for a bit?

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.870
I'll look around.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.500
Why's the signal coming
from the Momotaro tower?

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.160
Did he go there?

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:47.750
Iride!

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:50.870
I'm sorry...

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:53.950
Elder Kihachi spotted me.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.410
Let's keep on the move.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.950
I found... the dungeon.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:08.830
It's down the stairs in the
very back of the dog tower.

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:11.410
I have the key...

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.000
What's wrong?

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.200
Um...

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:18.870
I can't move my right arm.

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:23.040
I cannot... because of a promise.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.000
That's strange...

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:27.700
Why is Akki crying?

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.700
Hey, sorry to keep you.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.700
O-Onigasaki!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.580
I'll open it.

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:37.830
Okay!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:44.540
Make sure you rest it. It's probably broken.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.290
Let's get ourselves behind
the pheasant tower.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:51.120
From there, we can see the
smoke signal from the village.

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:52.040
Smoke signal?

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:54.000
As a landmark.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.200
Roro and them have a fire going.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.040
Is everyone out?

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:01.250
Let's go.

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:06.830
Sorry, go on without me.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.160
I need to confirm something.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.500
Go ahead with Iride.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.080
All right.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:20.830
Hey! What's wrong with you guys,
inviting yourselves in?!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:23.450
Ahh, my dolls escaped!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:27.080
Unbelievable! How could you
do this, you thieves?!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.700
You'll just have to make do with this.

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:39.160
I don't want this! I like things
that are pretty and cute! For example...

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:40.330
Huh?

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.250
What? You...

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:47.040
Your face looks familiar for some reason.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:53.290
Answer me. Two years ago, did you
take a girl with a face like mine?

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.750
Huh? Two years ago?

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.580
I forget.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:01.120
Well, remember!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:10.370
Who knows? Maybe I did,
but she's gone now, so...

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.750
I bet I got rid of her.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:21.290
What are you doing?!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:25.540
Oshigiri, you should go meet up
with Iride and the others.

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:27.540
But...!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:31.660
Because people who lose
their cool just get in the way.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.200
All right.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:45.500
Does he have a death wish? That's so funny!

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:49.200
That was the classic
"Go ahead and leave this to me!"

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.790
He's serious to a fault, so...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.290
Please don't tease him just for fun.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.290
Oh, so you knew I was lying then?

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:03.410
That's right. I only teased him
because he was acting that way.

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:07.410
As if I could remember
all of my dolls' faces anyway.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:11.950
Is that right? Then I can punish
you to my heart's content.

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:17.580
You get on my nerves.
I never liked you from the start.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:21.250
A trash doll like you should just be crushed.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:27.120
Grandpa, I'm right here! I don't want this one!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.080
Come here quick and stomp on him!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.330
Why...?

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:40.540
Why isn't he coming to help?

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:44.540
G-Grandpa! Grandpa!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.080
I'm sorry, Kikka.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:53.450
I still want to... be with you...

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:58.330
You really ought to stop sponging off him.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:02.870
If you don't learn to limit your selfishness,
he'll get disgusted with you.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:06.790
That's not true! My grandpa
loves me more than anything!

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:12.620
Are you stupid?! No grandpa
in the world hates their grandkids!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.580
Not necessarily.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:17.620
Not all families get along with each other.

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:20.200
Choose your own path and you get cast out.

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.830
It's only natural.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:29.580
Do you truly not remember her face?

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:51.000
Your family hates you, don't they?

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:58.160
You're envious, right? Of how well
my grandpa and I get along...

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:04.330
You poor thing.

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:10.290
You poor little doll, you.

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:25.330
You really don't trust me, do you?

00:22:25.330 --> 00:22:26.580
Onigasaki.

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:35.120
Let's go home.
